      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle. If you get weakness, slurred speech or a severe headache with the dizziness, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department. I'd like to see you again in two weeks. Tell me what you've taken from all that, so I can fill in any gaps.",
